{
  "opencollection": "1.0.0",
  "info": {
    "name": "Insights Enrichment Webhook Configurations API",
    "version": "3.1.3"
  },
  "request": {
    "auth": {
      "type": "oauth2",
      "flow": "client_credentials",
      "accessTokenUrl": "https://findmoney.fingoal.com/v3/authentication",
      "credentials": {
        "clientId": "{{clientId}}",
        "clientSecret": "{{clientSecret}}"
      }
    }
  },
  "items": [
    {
      "info": {
        "name": "Webhook Configurations",
        "type": "folder"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "List Webhook Configurations",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://findmoney-dev.fingoal.com/v3/webhook-configurations",
            "auth": {
              "type": "oauth2",
              "flow": "client_credentials",
              "accessTokenUrl": "https://findmoney.fingoal.com/v3/authentication",
              "credentials": {
                "clientId": "{{clientId}}",
                "clientSecret": "{{clientSecret}}"
              }
            }
          },
          "docs": "Retrieve all webhook configurations for your client. Configurations are organized into:\n- **default**: Configurations without a tenant_id that apply to your client's default callback URL\n- **tenants**: Tenant-specific configurations organized by tenant_id\n"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Create or Update Webhook Configuration",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "url": "https://findmoney-dev.fingoal.com/v3/webhook-configurations",
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "oauth2",
              "flow": "client_credentials",
              "accessTokenUrl": "https://findmoney.fingoal.com/v3/authentication",
              "credentials": {
                "clientId": "{{clientId}}",
                "clientSecret": "{{clientSecret}}"
              }
            }
          },
          "docs": "Create a new webhook configuration or update an existing one. Your `client_id` and `tenant_id` are automatically inferred from the bearer token on this request. To set up a webhook for a specific tenant, please ensure that the bearer token on this request as a `tenant_id` claim. If your bearer token lacks a `tenant_id`, the webhook will be created for your single-tenant environment.\n\n- If a configuration already exists for the same client/tenant/webhook_type combination, it will be updated.\n- If"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Delete Webhook Configuration",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": "https://findmoney-dev.fingoal.com/v3/webhook-configurations",
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "oauth2",
              "flow": "client_credentials",
              "accessTokenUrl": "https://findmoney.fingoal.com/v3/authentication",
              "credentials": {
                "clientId": "{{clientId}}",
                "clientSecret": "{{clientSecret}}"
              }
            }
          },
          "docs": "Remove a webhook configuration.\n\n- Specify `tenant_id` to delete a tenant-specific configuration.\n- Omit `tenant_id` to delete the default configuration.\n"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Test Webhook",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://findmoney-dev.fingoal.com/v3/webhook-configurations/test",
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "oauth2",
              "flow": "client_credentials",
              "accessTokenUrl": "https://findmoney.fingoal.com/v3/authentication",
              "credentials": {
                "clientId": "{{clientId}}",
                "clientSecret": "{{clientSecret}}"
              }
            }
          },
          "docs": "Test your webhook endpoint by triggering a sample payload. Useful for verifying your webhook receiver is working correctly.\n\nThe test payload varies by webhook type:\n- **ENRICHMENT_DATA**: Sample enriched transactions payload\n- **ENRICHMENT_NOTIFICATION**: Sample batch notification with batch_request_id\n- **USER_TAGS_DATA**: Sample user tags payload with created/deleted/modified arrays\n- **USER_TAGS_NOTIFICATION**: Sample notification with guid\n- **INSIGHTS**: Sample finsights array\n\nAll test we"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "bundled": true
}